[00:20.21]We’re both in love at the very first sight
[00:26.35]You would buy me flowers as a surprise
[00:31.90]Our memories in this city entwine
[00:36.90]They’re everywhere and we both can’t hide
[00:42.68]If I’m merely nobody in your eyes
[00:48.39]Then just pass by don’t leave longing behind
[00:54.16]At first you promised to bring me delight
[00:59.21]At last you made me cry
[01:04.76]Once you came into my life
[01:08.21]And lit up the whole sky
[01:10.63]So when passion fades away our patience dies
[01:15.69]Love’s a fate that both you and I should comply
[01:26.98]Once you would hurry through rain and wind just to hold me tight
[01:32.49]Now you’re indifferent to my tears and leave me wet inside
[01:38.15]It’s you who are fickle in love not the time
[01:43.12]Our romance’s so intense how’d you say goodbye
[01:49.21]Once you would cross far distance just to stay with me up all night
[01:54.74]Now you won’t say a word to me even though I’m by your side
[02:00.25]Can’t forget old memories of you and I
[02:05.18]You’re still on my mind
